{"text":"kuruntokai","n":98,"lines":["இன்ன ளாயினள் நன்னுதல் என்றவர்த்","துன்னச் சென்று செப்புநர்ப் பெறினே","நன்றுமன் வாழி தோழிநம் படப்பை","நீர்வார் பைம்புதற் கலித்த","மாரிப் பீரத் தலர்சில கொண்டே"],"tr":["iṉṉa ḷāyiṉaḷ naṉṉutal eṉṟavart","tuṉṉac ceṉṟu ceppunarp peṟiṉē","naṉṟumaṉ vāḻi tōḻinam paṭappai","nīrvār paimputaṟ kalitta","mārip pīrat talarcila koṇṭē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கோக்குள முற்றனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kōkkuḷa Muṟṟaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 12, veṇṭaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"இன்ன","tr":"iṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"ளாயினள்","tr":"ḷāyiṉaḷ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளா","tr":"ḷā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினள்","tr":"yiṉaḷ"}]},{"text":"நன்னுதல்","tr":"naṉṉutal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னுதல்","tr":"ṉutal"}]},{"text":"என்றவர்த்","tr":"eṉṟavart","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"என்","tr":"eṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவர்த்","tr":"ṟavart"}]}],[{"text":"துன்னச்","tr":"tuṉṉac","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"துன்","tr":"tuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னச்","tr":"ṉac"}]},{"text":"சென்று","tr":"ceṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சென்","tr":"ceṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"செப்புநர்ப்","tr":"ceppunarp","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செப்","tr":"cep"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புநர்ப்","tr":"punarp"}]},{"text":"பெறினே","tr":"peṟiṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெறி","tr":"peṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}],[{"text":"நன்றுமன்","tr":"naṉṟumaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுமன்","tr":"ṟumaṉ"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழிநம்","tr":"tōḻinam","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழிநம்","tr":"ḻinam"}]},{"text":"படப்பை","tr":"paṭappai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படப்","tr":"paṭap"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பை","tr":"pai"}]}],[{"text":"நீர்வார்","tr":"nīrvār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீர்","tr":"nīr"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வார்","tr":"vār"}]},{"text":"பைம்புதற்","tr":"paimputaṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பைம்","tr":"paim"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புதற்","tr":"putaṟ"}]},{"text":"கலித்த","tr":"kalitta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலித்","tr":"kalit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]}],[{"text":"மாரிப்","tr":"mārip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரிப்","tr":"rip"}]},{"text":"பீரத்","tr":"pīrat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பீ","tr":"pī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரத்","tr":"rat"}]},{"text":"தலர்சில","tr":"talarcila","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலர்","tr":"talar"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சில","tr":"cila"}]},{"text":"கொண்டே","tr":"koṇṭē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டே","tr":"ṭē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னள்","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"like this"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"such a woman"},{"surface":"ஆயினள்","parts":[{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"become"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she became"},{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good/beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"நுதல்","parts":[{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"nutal","gloss":"forehead"}],"gloss":"forehead"},{"surface":"என்று","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"say"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"அவர்த்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he/him"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"sandhi/accusative marker"}],"gloss":"him"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துன்னச்","parts":[{"text":"துன்னு","lemma":"tunnu","gloss":"approach"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"},{"text":"ச்","lemma":"c","gloss":"sandhi"}],"gloss":"to approach"},{"surface":"சென்று","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"சென்று","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செப்புநர்ப்","parts":[{"text":"செப்பு","lemma":"ceppu","gloss":"speak"},{"text":"நர்","lemma":"nar","gloss":"they who"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"p","gloss":"sandhi"}],"gloss":"those who speak"},{"surface":"பெறினே","parts":[{"text":"பெறு","lemma":"peṟu","gloss":"obtain"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"conditional suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"if we obtain indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்று","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"it is good"}],"gloss":"it is good","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"maṉ","gloss":"particle of regret/assertion"}],"gloss":"indeed/alas"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"vāḻ","gloss":"live"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"subjunctive suffix"}],"gloss":"may you live"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"நம்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"nam","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"படப்பை","parts":[{"text":"படப்பை","lemma":"paṭappai","gloss":"garden"}],"gloss":"garden"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water"},{"surface":"வார்","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"vār","gloss":"flowing"}],"gloss":"flowing"},{"surface":"பைம்","parts":[{"text":"பைம்","lemma":"பைம்","gloss":"green"}],"gloss":"green","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புதல்","parts":[{"text":"புதல்","lemma":"putal","gloss":"bush"}],"gloss":"bush"},{"surface":"கலித்த","parts":[{"text":"கலி","lemma":"kali","gloss":"flourish"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"tta","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"flourished"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாரி","parts":[{"text":"மாரி","lemma":"māri","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rain"},{"surface":"பீரத்து","parts":[{"text":"பீரத்து","lemma":"பீரத்து","gloss":"of the sponge gourd"}],"gloss":"of the sponge gourd","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அலர்","parts":[{"text":"அலர்","lemma":"alar","gloss":"blossom"}],"gloss":"blossoms"},{"surface":"சில","parts":[{"text":"சில","lemma":"cila","gloss":"some"}],"gloss":"some"},{"surface":"கொண்டு","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டு","lemma":"கொண்டு","gloss":"taking"}],"gloss":"taking","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"She became like this, she of the beautiful forehead, saying to him / approaching and going, those who would speak, if we obtain / it would be good indeed, may you live, friend, in our garden / where water flows, in the green bushes, flourished / rain-time sponge gourd's blossoms, some, taking.","translation":"O friend, may you live long! If only we could find messengers who would go to him, approach him, and say, 'She of the beautiful forehead has become like this,' taking with them a few blossoms of the sponge gourd that have flourished in the wet, green bushes of our garden during the rains, it would be so good indeed!","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! நம் வீட்டுத் தோட்டத்து ஈரமான பசுமையான புதர்களில் மழைக் காலத்தில் செழித்து மலர்ந்த பீர்க்கம்பூக்கள் சிலவற்றை எடுத்துக் கொண்டு, அவரிடம் சென்று, 'அழகிய நெற்றியை உடையவள் இவ்வாறு மெலிந்து போனாள்' என்று சொல்லக்கூடிய தூதுவர்களைப் பெற்றால் எவ்வளவு நன்றாக இருக்கும்!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend during the rainy season, which is the time the hero promised to return from his journey. Seeing the sponge gourd flowers blooming in her garden, which are yellow and symbolize her own paleness caused by separation, she feels deep grief. She wishes she could find messengers who would go to the hero and show him these flowers as proof of her suffering. The yellow blossoms of the sponge gourd represent the yellow-green pallor of pacaḷai that spreads over her skin due to her longing. Key words include 'பீரம்' (sponge gourd), 'அலர்' (blossoms), 'இன்னளாயினள்' (she became like this), and 'நன்னுதல்' (beautiful forehead).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.12,0.5],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,3.1],[3.1,3.1],[3.1,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[3.9,4.6],[4.6,4.7],[4.7,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,6.82],[6.93,7.04],[7.04,7.7],[7.7,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,9.3]],"female":[[0.9,0.9],[1.03,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,3.4],[3.4,3.4],[3.4,3.85],[3.85,4.12],[4.3,5.1],[5.1,5.2],[5.2,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.3],[6.3,6.3],[6.3,6.3],[6.3,8.25],[8.25,8.25],[8.25,8.25],[8.25,10.2]]}}